    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d162-a2">

                <pb facs="0575" n="424" xml:id="pg424"/>


                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian" when="1963-01-17"
                            >January 17, 1963</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In accordance with Mr. Foster’s
                    suggestion at the meeting yesterday, I am forwarding to you, at his request, an
                    outline of his remarks at that meeting dealing with the questions of automatic
                    seismic stations and procedures for on-site inspection.</p>
                <closer><signed>Alexander
                    Akalovsky</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
